      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIKE A BLAZE (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (22.94) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5 at Warrnambool. Has claims if she runs up to expectations. ZIPPING GLINDA (7) has a strong record this track and trip including two wins from four starts. Missed the frame latest (20.83) when fifth over 350m at Traralgon in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Suited here and expected to run well. PAW KIPLIN (1) drifted back from the inside but sliced through to hit the frame when a 3.5 lengths third (20.52) at Traralgon in Grade 5. Will give a great sight again. SMALL MERCIES (5) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance - solid claims again.",
